<conceptMap id="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.100.24.2" displayName="Specimen to SNOMED" effectiveDate="2026-08-27T00:00:00" statusCode="draft" lastModifiedDate="2026-09-11T00:00:00" url="http://art-decor.org/decor/services/" ident="synderai-">
        <desc language="en-US">
                <p>Maps specimen types to SNOMED CT specimen concepts. Every target was confirmed active and a descendant of 123038009 |Specimen| in the SNOMED CT International Edition, version 20260801, via a Snowstorm ValueSet/$expand on ECL &lt;&lt;123038009 followed by a CodeSystem/$lookup. Two groups. The first uses LOINC System Part codes as source. Only four could be confirmed on loinc.org
                    as Part Type System, so it holds four elements. The second carries all 73 specimen types through the local code system cs-specimen-label (2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.100.5.1), so each target is reachable whether or not a LOINC code exists for it. Its source codes are the sanitised form of the specimen label, reduced to letters and digits with every other character replaced by
                    an underscore. Rows added after 2026-09-10 were verified against version 20260901. The unmodified label is carried on each element as displayName and on the code system concept as the preferred designation.</p>
